                                "sense_id": "0aabaaa9-3aa4-3cf3-9cf5-dc776e82890c",
                                "text": "The courtier had practiced his bowing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2533b249-c2e4-4bb7-a9a1-027827c5f224",
                                "sense_id": "0aabaaa9-3aa4-3cf3-9cf5-dc776e82890c",
                                "text": "But it is not in the appearance of the fields, or of the cities, nor in the cuſtoms or genius of the inhabitants, that the country where you reſide has the great advantage over this land of darkneſs, but in the important article of religion; which here conſiſts almoſt entirely of external ſhow and gewgawry, of bowings, courteſies, and various geſticulations, of fantaſtical dreſſes, proceſſions, and other idle ceremonials, […]"
                            }
